{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "A Quiet Night at Home", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Between Friends", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 13, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Exchanging Opinions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "It's always important to be polite when you exchange opinions on a topic. The person you are talking to should be polite when they respond to your opinion as well.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "It's a good idea to use a variety of phrases when you give or respond to opinions, to keep the conversation interesting.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Giving an Opinion</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Responding to an Opinion</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm pretty sure that ... <br/>I'm fairly certain that ... <br/>I imagine ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I think so too!<br/>Of course you could.<br/>Absolutely!\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Anna</span>: <span class=\"strong\">I'm pretty sure</span> that I could teach you how to do some basic dishes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: I think so too!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Anna</span>: <span class=\"strong\">I'm fairly certain</span> that you could make time to do it.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Of course I could.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Anna</span>: <span class=\"strong\">I imagine</span> I could manage that.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Absolutely!", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking about Wishes and Imaginary Situations", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">wish</span> and the second conditional to talk about imaginary situations in the present or future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Wishes and sentences in the second conditional infer that what you want is probably not possible, or for some reason impossible.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Sentence</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I wish I could cook.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I don't know how to cook.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If I did, I wouldn't have to eat out so much.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I eat out a lot now.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It wouldn't take you long to master a few simple recipes if you tried.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You haven't tried.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I could make time if we planned ahead.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I don't have time now.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "just what we need", "type": "name"}, {"content": "what is necessary at the time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: A relaxing night is just what we need to recharge!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk with friends.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "touching", "type": "name"}, {"content": "heartwarming", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It was a touching film about an old man and his young grandson.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to make time", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to find the time you need to do something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I can make time to help you out next week.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to plan ahead", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to prepare before the event", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have to plan ahead when I need to take the time off work.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "sequel", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the continuation of a story", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "The sequel to this movie comes out next week!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to imagine", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to think; to assume", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I imagine he's very nice, but I don't know him well.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Imagine you can win a trip by writing a paragraph about it!", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain why you would like to win the trip.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Express your feelings and impressions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Say where you would go if you won, what you would do and who you would go with.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your contest entry to a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write about imaginary situations.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe my feelings and impressions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share my contest entry with a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le13ob03re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le13ob03re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, what did you think? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'd say that was just what we needed. It was a bit confusing to start but turned out to be charming, amusing and quite touching. The scenery was stunning.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm glad we weren't disappointed. I can pick up the sequel next time! Your snacks were amazing! They were both delicious and satisfying. I wish I could cook. If I did, I wouldn't have to eat out so much."}, {"image": "engenn7le13ob03re2img05.jpg", "time": "26000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm pretty sure that I could teach you how to do some basic dishes if you wanted. It wouldn't take you long to master a few simple recipes if you tried.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I think so too! I would like that if you had time.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm fairly certain that I could make time if we planned ahead. We could do one today if you wanted. What would you want in your fridge if you came home late?"}, {"image": "engenn7le13ob03re2img02.jpg", "time": "50000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: A pasta dish would be good if it were there for me. I imagine I could manage that.<br/>\n<span class=\"str